2,1,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,May,,"Let's be honest, the room is a mess and the rules are nonexistent. We need a real system so the same people aren't always cleaning up after everyone else.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,It's not just the mess. The noise carries directly into the office. It's becoming quite distracting for those of us sitting right next to the door.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience, my friends. Chaos is often just a sign that we have outgrown our old ways. Let us look at the facts before we decide our new path.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I agree! Let's turn this into a little mystery hunt! I want to know exactly how much we're spending and who is actually using the room.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I think we should also think about how we talk to each other. It feels like we're all strangers lately. We need a space where we can actually connect!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, connection is great, but not if it means I'm scrubbing crumbs off a table. I want to see who is actually in there and what the state of the bins is.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I'm more concerned about the physical barriers. I want to know if the partition wall is even doing anything to stop the sound.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,Time is our most precious resource. I wonder how many hours are lost to the upkeep of this room or the travel for our meals.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, good point! I bet there are some surprising numbers hidden in the invoices. Let's find out where the money is going!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"But what about the ""vibe""? I want to know where the awkward conversations happen. If we don't fix that, a new layout won't help us be friends.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"@Sakura, you're too excited! But fine, let's get the data. I'll check the usage tally and the bins. That'll show us who the real culprits are.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll look into the partition wall and the facilities callouts. I want to see if the noise issues have been reported before.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the invoices for outside hire and the round trip for a hot lunch. Let us see where our energy is being spent.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm on it! I'll check the quotes for the fit-outs and the invoices for outside hire too. I want to see the real costs on paper!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the unplanned talks since the refit and where the last awkward conversation happened. We need to know why we're avoiding each other!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Perfect. Let's gather the evidence and then we can stop guessing. I'm looking forward to seeing who's been slacking on the cleaning.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"Agreed. Let's focus on the environment first. If the room is too loud or dirty, no one will want to use it properly anyway.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,"A wise approach. When we understand the cost of our habits, the right solution usually reveals itself. I look forward to our findings.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Yay! This is like a detective game! I'll find all the secret numbers and we can make a super-smart decision together!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I just hope we remember that the room is for people, not just for ""functions."" Let's make it a place where we actually like being!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
