34,2,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,May,,"It's exactly as I thought. A few people are hogging the room, and the mess is spilling over into the office because the room is too chaotic.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The partition wall is practically useless. I can hear everything. It's not just a ""vibe"" issue; it's a structural failure that affects our focus.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,It is striking how much time we spend traveling for food. Twenty-five minutes a trip is a heavy toll on our vitality and our working hours.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Guys, look at the money! We're paying 68,000 yen for outside rooms because our break room can't do what we need! We're literally paying for a room we already have!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"That's exactly my point! I found out that the last ""difficult"" talk happened right at our desks. We have nowhere to go when things get tough.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Sakura, if we're paying for outside rooms, why not just invest that money into a strict management system for our own room? No more ""first come, first served.""","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"A management system won't stop the sound. If we want a space for ""difficult talks"" or focus, we need soundproofing or a complete change in purpose.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"We must consider the human cost. If we can bring the ""hot lunch"" closer or make the room a place of true restoration, we save hours of fatigue.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"But the fit-out quotes are way higher than the hourly hire! 141,000 yen for a meeting setup is a lot, but it stops the monthly bleeding of cash!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, you're right about the sound. If we can't have a private conversation without the whole office hearing, we'll always be strangers. We need a ""safe"" zone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"I don't care if it's a ""safe zone"" or a ""lunch zone,"" as long as there's a schedule. I'm tired of the ambiguity. Who cleans? Who books?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"If we make it a dedicated quiet zone or a dining area, the noise profile changes. A dining area is loud, but a meeting room must be silent.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,Let us not forget that a room that serves too many masters serves none. Perhaps we should choose one primary purpose to protect our peace.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"I've been crunching the numbers in my head! If we spend the 141,000 yen now, we stop paying those outside invoices. It's a smart investment for the future!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"I agree with the investment, but only if the design includes a way to talk privately. I don't want another ""desk-side"" awkward conversation.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,"Fine, but the ""investment"" must include a cleaning rota. I'm not playing the role of the office maid just because I'm the only one who notices the crumbs.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I'll support any option that actually fixes the sound leakage. Whether it's a lounge or a meeting room, the current wall is unacceptable.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,"It seems we are balancing three needs: the need for silence, the need for nourishment, and the need for connection. Let us see which weighs heaviest.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"Let's just make sure we don't pick the most expensive option if it doesn't solve the problem! We need the most ""bang for our buck,"" as they say!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'll vote for whatever makes us feel more like a team. If we can't talk honestly, we're just people sharing a zip code, not a workplace.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
